//   Loot: Rewards.json table rolled on defeat (LootChance of the time, default 0.4); the item
//     shows as a reward toast. The loot-* tables hold the game's sellable combat junk (category 43).
//   GearChance: chance (default 0.08) a defeat also drops gear for the killer's job (JobGear.json).
